<title>LUXEMBOURG: Finland sees stability pact ratified next week.</title>
<headline>Finland sees stability pact ratified next week.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Finance Minister Sauli Niinisto said on Sunday he was confident the European Union stability pact would be ratified at the EU summit in Amsterdam next week.</p>
<p>&quot;I am quite confident,&quot; he said in reponse to a question on the pact as he entered a finance ministers meeting in Luxembourg.</p>
</text>
